,{"ratio":0.92,"watchRatio":0.45345},{"ratio":0.93,"watchRatio":0.4488},{"ratio":0.94,"watchRatio":0.4458},{"ratio":0.95,"watchRatio":0.43979999999999997},{"ratio":0.96,"watchRatio":0.43235},{"ratio":0.97,"watchRatio":0.4235},{"ratio":0.98,"watchRatio":0.4112},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.39765},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.39415}],"script":{"source_path":"2026-11-collab-ram-ring-hanuman.md","words":322,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"The golden hour had come to Ayodhya, but"},{"sec":2.6,"text":"the [music] light that filled the royal"},{"sec":3.9,"text":"chambers was heavy with the impending"},{"sec":6.2,"text":"departure of its lord, Sri Ram. Sitting"},{"sec":8.6,"text":"on the throne, his face exuded poise. He"},{"sec":11.2,"text":"knew that his time on earth had come to"},{"sec":13.1,"text":"an end as he had concluded the purpose"},{"sec":15.2,"text":"of his earthly incarnation. Fully"},{"sec":17.2,"text":"prepared for his journey to the Vaikund,"},{"sec":19.1,"text":"he knew that Yamaraj was to approach"},{"sec":20.8,"text":"him. However, on the threshold stood"},{"sec":23.2,"text":"Lord Hanuman, the fierce and ardent"},{"sec":25.1,"text":"devotee of Sri Ram. No wind, no shadow,"},{"sec":27.7,"text":"no god could pass his watch. To gently"},{"sec":30.2,"text":"distract Hanuman, [music] Sri Ram"},{"sec":31.5,"text":"intentionally dropped his golden signet"},{"sec":33.7,"text":"ring through a small crack in the palace"},{"sec":35.7,"text":"floor. He asked Hanuman to retrieve it"},{"sec":37.8,"text":"for him. At once, Lord Hanuman shrank"},{"sec":39.9,"text":"himself [music] down to the size of a"},{"sec":41.4,"text":"beetle and entered the crack. He had"},{"sec":43.5,"text":"entered the Naglok, the serpent realm."},{"sec":46,"text":"There he met Vasuki, the king of"},{"sec":48,"text":"serpents, and asked him to help him find"},{"sec":50.1,"text":"the ring. Vasuki led him to the center"},{"sec":52.4,"text":"of Naglok, where Lord Hanuman was"},{"sec":54.4,"text":"startled at seeing massive, towering"},{"sec":56.7,"text":"heap of identical rings. To his utter"},{"sec":59.1,"text":"confusion, every single ring that he"},{"sec":61.2,"text":"picked was identical to Sri Ram's ring."},{"sec":63.8,"text":"Hanuman fell to his knees bewildered."},{"sec":65.9,"text":"How could there be millions of his rings"},{"sec":67.9,"text":"when there is only one Ram? To this,"},{"sec":70.2,"text":"Vasuki explained him the doctrine of"},{"sec":72.2,"text":"cosmic time, the kalpas. The universe"},{"sec":75,"text":"goes through endless cycles of creation"},{"sec":77,"text":"and destruction, and in each cycle, a"},{"sec":79.4,"text":"Sri Ram is born, performs his cosmic"},{"sec":81.7,"text":"part, and leaves his earthly"},{"sec":83,"text":"incarnation. The colossal mountain of"},{"sec":85.4,"text":"rings represented past Ram avatars"},{"sec":87.8,"text":"across infinite universes. This"},{"sec":90,"text":"realization humbled Hanuman and made him"},{"sec":92.3,"text":"realize that time is a continuous wheel."},{"sec":94.8,"text":"Hanuman bowed low to Vasuki in profound"},{"sec":97.2,"text":"gratitude. He turned and began his"},{"sec":99.2,"text":"journey back to the surface, only to bid"},{"sec":101.5,"text":"his eternal lord a beautiful, necessary"},{"sec":103.5,"text":"[music] farewell."}],"text":""}}